{"id":"tesoro","lemma":"tesoro","pos":"noun","rank":1438,"glosses":["treasure, trove, treasure trove","thesaurus","treasury, exchequer (sometimes capitalized)"],"ipa":"/teˈsoɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tesoros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-tesoro.wav","examples":[{"text":"El silencio es un tesoro.","en":"Silence is golden.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444461","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"silence"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Estábamos buscando un tesoro enterrado.","en":"We were looking for buried treasure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599973","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to seek","l":"buscar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"buried"}]},{"text":"Admitió haber robado el tesoro.","en":"He admitted that he had stolen the treasure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552733","words":[{"g":"to accept","l":"admitir"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"stolen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Pocos tesoros son tan valiosos como un amigo.","en":"Few treasures are worth as much as a friend.","words":[{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so, as"},{"g":"valuable","l":"valioso"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"friend"}]},{"text":"Este balón es el tesoro de ese niño.","en":"This ball is that boy's treasure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684266","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"ball"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"child, boy"}]}]}